			<zone xml:id="p2z3-0" points="1725,1234 2127,1194 2593,1240 2694,1184 2802,1190 2630,1122 2573,1159 2393,1127 1974,1191 1728,1160">1735,1206 1788,1208 1842,1205 1895,1201 1949,1203 2003,1194 2056,1194 2110,1193 2163,1191 2217,1189 2271,1188 2324,1187 2378,1184 2431,1184 2485,1185 2539,1182 2592,1181 2646,1176 2699,1176 2753,1174 2807,1173</zone>
